      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over time and with scale, we expect that our costs per user will decrease and that we will provide more and better services to our patients.",
        "start_character": 20722,
        "end_character": 20862
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our success in developing initial products, underscored by our emphasis on user-friendly solutions, will set a solid foundation for our future endeavors.",
        "start_character": 46784,
        "end_character": 46953
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe there are no products on the market that are portable, easy to use, and always with the patient to provide physicians with timely and highly accurate information about heart conditions that could be detected with a standard 12L ECG.",
        "start_character": 8104,
        "end_character": 8347
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have now developed a working prototype of a synthesized 12-lead capable patch ECG monitor that will provide advantages over existing single-lead ECG patch products such as the Zio Monitor from iRhythm Technologies, Inc.",
        "start_character": 50317,
        "end_character": 50539
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Where possible, we anticipate these factors in our product development processes.",
        "start_character": 67892,
        "end_character": 67973
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we own all proprietary molds and tooling for key plastic components, which provides additional manufacturing flexibility as demand grows.",
        "start_character": 70187,
        "end_character": 70338
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Concurrently, we are developing a number of AI-based cardiac disease detection algorithms to become the cornerstone of our commercialized systems.",
        "start_character": 49826,
        "end_character": 49972
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2025, we made significant progress in advancing our manufacturing readiness as we transition to commercial production.",
        "start_character": 69272,
        "end_character": 69397
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For our initial markets, we plan to establish a small, direct sales network with relationships and experience selling to our target markets.",
        "start_character": 20863,
        "end_character": 21003
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Given the dynamic nature of global supply chains and component availability, we continue to actively monitor our sourcing strategy and manufacturing partners to support continuity of supply and readiness to meet anticipated demand.",
        "start_character": 70819,
        "end_character": 71050
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-104080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-104080-5892f8011f6f9ad0",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-104080",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "This innovation aims to provide standard of care 12L ECG capabilities in a form factor like current single-lead ECG patches, which we believe addresses a critical gap in the market.",
